v2.3.0
DSimu:
    1. Add Signal (Dark Photon) Mass in yaml file
    2. Add PNZ, ENZ (Z Position), ENEnergy in DEvent
    3. Add Branch: Weight


v2.2.0
Global:
    1. Add a control class, which handle all variables, easy to manage the whole data.
    2. User can change variables by a yaml file

DSimu:
    1. Add MC Particle Contribution to Simulated Hits; Only the three most contributed particles will be recorded.
    2. Tracker Hits is pixelized along trackers z position. (hit position z is fixed for each tracker layer).
    3. Detector Overlay has been solved.
    4. new Filter is added. (See readme for more details)
    5. Dark Physics is added, still under validation.

DAna:
    1. Add geometry in config file; One can access to geomerty by gGeoManager, with including header file "TGeoManager.h"
    2. Add command "DAna -x", which will print out an example config.txt

DDis:
    1. Add the full detector geometry display.
    2. Add SimulatedHits Collection display; Add initial particle step collection display; Add MC particle tracks display.
    3. Now support Ana Processor module. One can easily visualize the processing of AnaProcessor.

DPlot:
    1. read yaml file as config file
    2. Easy to make some comparison plots

v2.1.1
Added DDis module, which can print out the detector geometry very fast

v2.1.0
Added bunches of detector messenger in DSimu, so that users can change the detector geometry in the config file, without
re-compiling the DSimu.
